    "text": "<blockquote><p>To find&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8596;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We know&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8596;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8596;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow